# Line endings: LF everywhere.
#
# CI runs on Linux and Prettier is configured with endOfLine: lf. Windows checkouts
# would otherwise rewrite files to CRLF through core.autocrlf and make format:check
# fail locally on an untouched tree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries: never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.aab binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
